{"v":[{"a":["سَأَلَ","سَآئِلُۢ","بِعَذَابٖ","وَاقِعٖ"],"t":"A questioner questioned the imminent torment","l":"Sa'ala Sa'ilun Bi`adhabin Waqi`in","w":[["sa-ala","Asked"],["sāilun","a questioner"],["biʿadhābin","about a punishment"],["wāqiʿin","bound to happen"]]},{"a":["لِّلۡكَٰفِرِينَ","لَيۡسَ","لَهُۥ","دَافِعٞ"],"t":"For the disbelievers; none can repel it","l":"Lilkafiryna Laysa Lahu Dafi`un","w":[["lil'kāfirīna","To the disbelievers"],["laysa","not"],["lahu","of it"],["dāfiʿun","any preventer"]]},{"a":["مِّنَ","ٱللَّهِ","ذِي","ٱلۡمَعَارِجِ"],"t":"From God, Lord of the Ways of Ascent","l":"Mina Allahi Dhi Al-Ma`ariji","w":[["mina","From"],["l-lahi","Allah"],["dhī","Owner"],["l-maʿāriji","(of) the ways of ascent"]]},{"a":["تَعۡرُجُ","ٱلۡمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","وَٱلرُّوحُ","إِلَيۡهِ","فِي","يَوۡمٖ","كَانَ","مِقۡدَارُهُۥ","خَمۡسِينَ","أَلۡفَ","سَنَةٖ"],"t":"Unto Him the angels and the Spirit ascend on a Day the duration of which is fifty thousand years","l":"Ta`ruju Al-Mala'ikatu Wa Ar-Ruhu 'Ilayhi Fi Yawmin Kana Miqdaruhu Khamsina 'Alfa Sanahin","w":[["taʿruju","Ascend"],["l-malāikatu","the Angels"],["wal-rūḥu","and the Spirit"],["ilayhi","to Him"],["fī","in"],["yawmin","a Day"],["kāna","[is]"],["miq'dāruhu","its measure"],["khamsīna","(is) fifty"],["alfa","thousand"],["sanatin","year(s)"]]},{"a":["فَٱصۡبِرۡ","صَبۡرٗا","جَمِيلًا"],"t":"So be patient, with sweet patience","l":"Fasbir Sabraan Jamilaan","w":[["fa-iṣ'bir","So be patient"],["ṣabran","a patience"],["jamīlan","good"]]},{"a":["إِنَّهُمۡ","يَرَوۡنَهُۥ","بَعِيدٗا"],"t":"They see it distant","l":"Innahum Yarawnahu Ba`idaan","w":[["innahum","Indeed, they"],["yarawnahu","see it"],["baʿīdan","(as) far off"]]},{"a":["وَنَرَىٰهُ","قَرِيبٗا"],"t":"But We see it near","l":"Wa Narahu Qaribaan","w":[["wanarāhu","But We see it"],["qarīban","near"]]},{"a":["يَوۡمَ","تَكُونُ","ٱلسَّمَآءُ","كَٱلۡمُهۡلِ"],"t":"On the Day when the sky will be like molten brass","l":"Yawma Takunu As-Sama'u Kalmuhli","w":[["yawma","(The) Day "],["takūnu","will be"],["l-samāu","the sky"],["kal-muh'li","like molten copper"]]},{"a":["وَتَكُونُ","ٱلۡجِبَالُ","كَٱلۡعِهۡنِ"],"t":"And the mountains will be like tufted wool","l":"Wa Takunu Al-Jibalu Kal`ihni","w":[["watakūnu","And will be"],["l-jibālu","the mountains"],["kal-ʿih'ni","like wool"]]},{"a":["وَلَا","يَسۡـَٔلُ","حَمِيمٌ","حَمِيمٗا"],"t":"No friend will care about his friend","l":"Wa La Yas'alu Hamimun Hamimaan","w":[["walā","And not"],["yasalu","will ask"],["ḥamīmun","a friend"],["ḥamīman","(about) a friend"]]},{"a":["يُبَصَّرُونَهُمۡۚ","يَوَدُّ","ٱلۡمُجۡرِمُ","لَوۡ","يَفۡتَدِي","مِنۡ","عَذَابِ","يَوۡمِئِذِۭ","بِبَنِيهِ"],"t":"They will be shown each other. The criminal wishes he would be redeemed from the punishment of that Day by his children","l":"Yubassarunahum Yawaddu Al-Mujrimu Law Yaftadi Min `Adhabi Yawmi'idhin Bibanihi","w":[["yubaṣṣarūnahum","They will be made to see each other"],["yawaddu","Would wish"],["l-muj'rimu","the criminal"],["law","if"],["yaftadī","he (could be) ransomed"],["min","from"],["ʿadhābi","(the) punishment"],["yawmi-idhin","(of) that Day"],["bibanīhi","by his children"]]},{"a":["وَصَٰحِبَتِهِۦ","وَأَخِيهِ"],"t":"And his spouse, and his brother","l":"Wa Sahibatihi Wa 'Akhihi","w":[["waṣāḥibatihi","And his spouse"],["wa-akhīhi","and his brother"]]},{"a":["وَفَصِيلَتِهِ","ٱلَّتِي","تُـٔۡوِيهِ"],"t":"And his family that sheltered him","l":"Wa Fasilatihi Allati Tu'uwyhi","w":[["wafaṣīlatihi","And his nearest kindred"],["allatī","who"],["tu'wīhi","sheltered him"]]},{"a":["وَمَن","فِي","ٱلۡأَرۡضِ","جَمِيعٗا","ثُمَّ","يُنجِيهِ"],"t":"And everyone on earth, in order to save him","l":"Wa Man Fi Al-'Arđi Jami`aan Thumma Yunjihi","w":[["waman","And whoever"],["fī","(is) on"],["l-arḍi","the earth"],["jamīʿan","all"],["thumma","then"],["yunjīhi","it (could) save him"]]},{"a":["كَلَّآۖ","إِنَّهَا","لَظَىٰ"],"t":"By no means! It is a Raging Fire","l":"Kalla 'Innaha Laza","w":[["kallā","By no means"],["innahā","Indeed, it (is)"],["laẓā","surely a Flame of Hell"]]},{"a":["نَزَّاعَةٗ","لِّلشَّوَىٰ"],"t":"It strips away the scalps","l":"Nazza`atan Lilshawa","w":[["nazzāʿatan","A remover"],["lilshawā","of the skin of the head"]]},{"a":["تَدۡعُواْ","مَنۡ","أَدۡبَرَ","وَتَوَلَّىٰ"],"t":"It invites him who once turned his back and fled","l":"Tad`u Man 'Adbara Wa Tawalla","w":[["tadʿū","Inviting"],["man","(him) who"],["adbara","turned his back"],["watawallā","and went away"]]},{"a":["وَجَمَعَ","فَأَوۡعَىٰٓ"],"t":"And accumulated and hoarded","l":"Wa Jama`a Fa'aw`a","w":[["wajamaʿa","And collected"],["fa-awʿā","and hoarded"]]},{"a":["۞إِنَّ","ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ","خُلِقَ","هَلُوعًا"],"t":"Man was created restless","l":"Inna Al-'Insana Khuliqa Halu`aan","w":[["inna","Indeed"],["l-insāna","the man"],["khuliqa","was created"],["halūʿan","anxious "]]},{"a":["إِذَا","مَسَّهُ","ٱلشَّرُّ","جَزُوعٗا"],"t":"Touched by adversity, he is fretful","l":"Idha Massahu Ash-Sharru Jazu`aan","w":[["idhā","When"],["massahu","touches him"],["l-sharu","the evil"],["jazūʿan","distressed"]]},{"a":["وَإِذَا","مَسَّهُ","ٱلۡخَيۡرُ","مَنُوعًا"],"t":"Touched by good, he is ungenerous","l":"Wa 'Idha Massahu Al-Khayru Manu`aan","w":[["wa-idhā","And when"],["massahu","touches him"],["l-khayru","the good"],["manūʿan","withholding"]]},{"a":["إِلَّا","ٱلۡمُصَلِّينَ"],"t":"Except the prayerful","l":"Illa Al-Musallina","w":[["illā","Except"],["l-muṣalīna","those who pray "]]},{"a":["ٱلَّذِينَ","هُمۡ","عَلَىٰ","صَلَاتِهِمۡ","دَآئِمُونَ"],"t":"Those who are constant at their prayers","l":"Al-Ladhina Hum `Ala Salatihim Da'imuna","w":[["alladhīna","Those who"],["hum","[they]"],["ʿalā","at"],["ṣalātihim","their prayer"],["dāimūna","(are) constant"]]},{"a":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","فِيٓ","أَمۡوَٰلِهِمۡ","حَقّٞ","مَّعۡلُومٞ"],"t":"And those in whose wealth is a rightful share","l":"Wa Al-Ladhina Fi 'Amwalihim Haqqun Ma`lumun","w":[["wa-alladhīna","And those who"],["fī","in"],["amwālihim","their wealth"],["ḥaqqun","(is) a right"],["maʿlūmun","known"]]},{"a":["لِّلسَّآئِلِ","وَٱلۡمَحۡرُومِ"],"t":"For the beggar and the deprived","l":"Lilssa'ili Wa Al-Mahrumi","w":[["lilssāili","For the one who asks"],["wal-maḥrūmi","and the deprived"]]},{"a":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","يُصَدِّقُونَ","بِيَوۡمِ","ٱلدِّينِ"],"t":"And those who affirm the Day of Judgment","l":"Wa Al-Ladhina Yusaddiquna Biyawmi Ad-Dini","w":[["wa-alladhīna","And those who"],["yuṣaddiqūna","accept (the) truth"],["biyawmi","(of the) Day"],["l-dīni","(of) the Judgment"]]},{"a":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","هُم","مِّنۡ","عَذَابِ","رَبِّهِم","مُّشۡفِقُونَ"],"t":"And those who fear the punishment of their Lord","l":"Wa Al-Ladhina Hum Min `Adhabi Rabbihim Mushfiquna","w":[["wa-alladhīna","And those who"],["hum","[they]"],["min","of"],["ʿadhābi","(the) punishment"],["rabbihim","(of) their Lord"],["mush'fiqūna","(are) fearful "]]},{"a":["إِنَّ","عَذَابَ","رَبِّهِمۡ","غَيۡرُ","مَأۡمُونٖ"],"t":"Their Lord’s punishment is not to be taken for granted","l":"Inna `Adhaba Rabbihim Ghayru Ma'munin","w":[["inna","Indeed"],["ʿadhāba","(the) punishment"],["rabbihim","(of) your Lord"],["ghayru","(is) not"],["mamūnin","to be felt secure (of) "]]},{"a":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","هُمۡ","لِفُرُوجِهِمۡ","حَٰفِظُونَ"],"t":"And those who guard their chastity","l":"Wa Al-Ladhina Hum Lifurujihim Hafizuna","w":[["wa-alladhīna","And those who"],["hum","[they]"],["lifurūjihim","their modesty"],["ḥāfiẓūna","(are) guardians"]]},{"a":["إِلَّا","عَلَىٰٓ","أَزۡوَٰجِهِمۡ","أَوۡ","مَا","مَلَكَتۡ","أَيۡمَٰنُهُمۡ","فَإِنَّهُمۡ","غَيۡرُ","مَلُومِينَ"],"t":"Except from their spouses or those living under their control, for then they are free of blame","l":"Illa `Ala 'Azwajihim 'Aw Ma Malakat 'Aymanuhum Fa'innahum Ghayru Malumina","w":[["illā","Except"],["ʿalā","from"],["azwājihim","their spouses"],["aw","or"],["mā","what"],["malakat","they possess"],["aymānuhum","rightfully"],["fa-innahum","then indeed, they"],["ghayru","(are) not"],["malūmīna","blameworthy"]]},{"a":["فَمَنِ","ٱبۡتَغَىٰ","وَرَآءَ","ذَٰلِكَ","فَأُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ","هُمُ","ٱلۡعَادُونَ"],"t":"But whoever seeks to go beyond that—these are the transgressors","l":"Famani Abtagha Wara'a Dhalika Fa'ula'ika Humu Al-`Aduna","w":[["famani","But whoever"],["ib'taghā","seeks"],["warāa","beyond"],["dhālika","that"],["fa-ulāika","then those"],["humu","[they]"],["l-ʿādūna","(are) the transgressors "]]},{"a":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","هُمۡ","لِأَمَٰنَٰتِهِمۡ","وَعَهۡدِهِمۡ","رَٰعُونَ"],"t":"And those who honor their trusts and their pledges","l":"Wa Al-Ladhina Hum Li'manatihim Wa `Ahdihim Ra`una","w":[["wa-alladhīna","And those who"],["hum","[they]"],["li-amānātihim","of their trusts"],["waʿahdihim","and their promise"],["rāʿūna","(are) observers"]]},{"a":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","هُم","بِشَهَٰدَٰتِهِمۡ","قَآئِمُونَ"],"t":"And those who stand by their testimonies","l":"Wa Al-Ladhina Hum Bishahadatihim Qa'imuna","w":[["wa-alladhīna","And those who"],["hum","[they]"],["bishahādātihim","in their testimonies"],["qāimūna","stand firm"]]},{"a":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","هُمۡ","عَلَىٰ","صَلَاتِهِمۡ","يُحَافِظُونَ"],"t":"And those who are dedicated to their prayers","l":"Wa Al-Ladhina Hum `Ala Salatihim Yuhafizuna","w":[["wa-alladhīna","And those who"],["hum","[they]"],["ʿalā","on"],["ṣalātihim","their prayer"],["yuḥāfiẓūna","keep a guard "]]},{"a":["أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ","فِي","جَنَّـٰتٖ","مُّكۡرَمُونَ"],"t":"These will be honored in Gardens","l":"Ula'ika Fi Jannatin Mukramuna","w":[["ulāika","Those"],["fī","(will be) in"],["jannātin","Gardens"],["muk'ramūna","honored"]]},{"a":["فَمَالِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُواْ","قِبَلَكَ","مُهۡطِعِينَ"],"t":"What is with those who disbelieve, stretching their necks towards you","l":"Famali Al-Ladhina Kafaru Qibalaka Muhti`ina","w":[["famāli","So what is with"],["alladhīna","those who"],["kafarū","disbelieve"],["qibalaka","before you"],["muh'ṭiʿīna","(they) hasten"]]},{"a":["عَنِ","ٱلۡيَمِينِ","وَعَنِ","ٱلشِّمَالِ","عِزِينَ"],"t":"From the right, and from the left, banding together","l":"Ani Al-Yamini Wa `Ani Ash-Shimali `Izina","w":[["ʿani","On"],["l-yamīni","the right"],["waʿani","and on"],["l-shimāli","the left"],["ʿizīna","(in) separate groups"]]},{"a":["أَيَطۡمَعُ","كُلُّ","ٱمۡرِيٕٖ","مِّنۡهُمۡ","أَن","يُدۡخَلَ","جَنَّةَ","نَعِيمٖ"],"t":"Is every one of them aspiring to be admitted into a Garden of Bliss","l":"Ayatma`u Kullu Amri'in Minhum 'An Yudkhala Jannata Na`imin","w":[["ayaṭmaʿu","Does long"],["kullu","every"],["im'ri-in","person"],["min'hum","among them"],["an","that"],["yud'khala","he enters"],["jannata","a Garden"],["naʿīmin","(of) Delight"]]},{"a":["كَلَّآۖ","إِنَّا","خَلَقۡنَٰهُم","مِّمَّا","يَعۡلَمُونَ"],"t":"No indeed! We created them from what they know","l":"Kalla 'Inna Khalaqnahum Mimma Ya`lamuna","w":[["kallā","By no means"],["innā","Indeed, We"],["khalaqnāhum","[We] have created them"],["mimmā","from what"],["yaʿlamūna","they know"]]},{"a":["فَلَآ","أُقۡسِمُ","بِرَبِّ","ٱلۡمَشَٰرِقِ","وَٱلۡمَغَٰرِبِ","إِنَّا","لَقَٰدِرُونَ"],"t":"I swear by the Lord of the Easts and the Wests, that We are Able","l":"Fala 'Uqsimu Birabbi Al-Mashariqi Wa Al-Magharibi 'Inna Laqadiruna","w":[["falā","But nay"],["uq'simu","I swear"],["birabbi","by (the) Lord"],["l-mashāriqi","(of) the risings"],["wal-maghāribi","and the settings"],["innā","that We"],["laqādirūna","(are) surely Able"]]},{"a":["عَلَىٰٓ","أَن","نُّبَدِّلَ","خَيۡرٗا","مِّنۡهُمۡ","وَمَا","نَحۡنُ","بِمَسۡبُوقِينَ"],"t":"To replace them with better than they, and We are not to be outdone","l":"Ala 'An Nubaddila Khayraan Minhum Wa Ma Nahnu Bimasbuqina","w":[["ʿalā","[On]"],["an","to"],["nubaddila","[We] replace"],["khayran","(with) better"],["min'hum","than them"],["wamā","and not"],["naḥnu","We"],["bimasbūqīna","(are) to be outrun"]]},{"a":["فَذَرۡهُمۡ","يَخُوضُواْ","وَيَلۡعَبُواْ","حَتَّىٰ","يُلَٰقُواْ","يَوۡمَهُمُ","ٱلَّذِي","يُوعَدُونَ"],"t":"So leave them to blunder and play, until they meet their Day which they are promised","l":"Fadharhum Yakhuđu Wa Yal`abu Hatta Yulaqu Yawmahumu Al-Ladhi Yu`aduna","w":[["fadharhum","So leave them"],["yakhūḍū","(to) converse vainly"],["wayalʿabū","and amuse themselves"],["ḥattā","until"],["yulāqū","they meet"],["yawmahumu","their Day"],["alladhī","which"],["yūʿadūna","they are promised"]]},{"a":["يَوۡمَ","يَخۡرُجُونَ","مِنَ","ٱلۡأَجۡدَاثِ","سِرَاعٗا","كَأَنَّهُمۡ","إِلَىٰ","نُصُبٖ","يُوفِضُونَ"],"t":"The Day when they will emerge from the tombs in a rush, as though they were hurrying towards a target","l":"Yawma Yakhrujuna Mina Al-'Ajdathi Sira`aan Ka'annahum 'Ila Nusubin Yufiđuna","w":[["yawma","(The) Day"],["yakhrujūna","they will come out"],["mina","from"],["l-ajdāthi","the graves"],["sirāʿan","rapidly"],["ka-annahum","as if they (were)"],["ilā","to"],["nuṣubin","a goal"],["yūfiḍūna","hastening"]]},{"a":["خَٰشِعَةً","أَبۡصَٰرُهُمۡ","تَرۡهَقُهُمۡ","ذِلَّةٞۚ","ذَٰلِكَ","ٱلۡيَوۡمُ","ٱلَّذِي","كَانُواْ","يُوعَدُونَ"],"t":"Their eyes cast down; overwhelmed by humiliation. This is the Day which they were promised","l":"Khashi`atan 'Absaruhum Tarhaquhum Dhillatun Dhalika Al-Yawmu Al-Ladhi Kanu Yu`aduna","w":[["khāshiʿatan","Humbled"],["abṣāruhum","their eyesights"],["tarhaquhum","will cover them"],["dhillatun","humiliation"],["dhālika","That"],["l-yawmu","(is) the Day"],["alladhī","which"],["kānū","they were"],["yūʿadūna","promised"]]}]}